-- Control for applyEnumOperandPair: the same distribution written WITHOUT an
-- application, once as a nullary top-level binding (left operand) and once with
-- the helper body inlined at the use site (right operand). Both shapes compiled
-- before the applied form did, and must keep compiling to the same answer.
coin = if Uniform < 0.5 then 0 else 1
bumped = coin ++ 1
main = bumped ++ (coin ++ 1)
